WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.525
A game suits Arcade when it's made from the engine's building blocks.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:10.076
Built for it: catch, dodge, shooters, runners, mazes and platformers.

3
00:00:10.981 --> 00:00:14.881
Possible with work: card games, quizzes, turning cars.

4
00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:21.592
Not a good fit: 3D, real physics, or detailed art.
